k arkb-boxLink -vertical\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"link\" data-arkb-linkbox=\"1\"><div class=\"arkb-boxLink__inner\"><figure class=\"arkb-boxLink__figure\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"arkb-boxLink__img wp-image-6451\" src=\"https://cross-com.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Agentic-CRM設計支援.webp\" alt=\"Agentic CRM設計支援\" width=\"2519\" height=\"1287\" srcset=\"https://cross-com.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Agentic-CRM設計支援.webp 2519w, https://cross-com.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Agentic-CRM設計支援-300x153.webp 300w, https://cross-com.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Agentic-CRM設計支援-1024x523.webp 1024w, https://cross-com.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Agentic-CRM設計支援-768x392.webp 768w, https://cross-com.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Agentic-CRM設計支援-1536x785.webp 1536w, https://cross-com.jp/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/Agentic-CRM設計支援-2048x1046.webp 2048w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 2519px) 100vw, 2519px\" /></figure><div class=\"arkb-boxLink__body\"><div class=\"arkb-boxLink__title\"><strong><span class=\"arkb-format-1\">Agentic CRM設計支援</span></strong></div><div class=\"arkb-boxLink__content ark-keep-mt--s\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">オープンソースCRMを基盤にAIの推論能力に最大化したAIネイティブなCRMを貴社専用に設計します。</p>\n</div><div class=\"arkb-boxLink__more\"><span class=\"arkb-boxLink__more__text\">READ MORE</span><svg class=\"arkb-boxLink__more__svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 32 32\" role=\"img\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M30.4,15.5l-4.5-4.5l-1.1,1.1l3.4,3.4H1.6v1.6h28.8V15.5z\" /></svg></div></div></div><a data-arkb-link=\"1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" href=\"https://cross-com.jp/service/agentic-crm-design/\">&lt;strong>&lt;span class=\"arkb-format-1\">Agentic CRM設計支援&lt;/span>&lt;/strong></a></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n",
